./checks/audit-B.md:45:12. **SHOULD** `deck.html:116, 117, 131, 156, 327-328` - magic numbers that should be tokens. Type sizes off the scale: `.row .t 48px` (116), `.row .m 32px` (117), `.todo 34px` (131); add `--text-row:48px; --text-row-sub:32px` (or snap to `--text-md`/`--text-sm`; note `.row .m` at 32 sits between sm 30 and md 40). `.notes` uses `3px`, `28px 100px`, `30px` (156) next to existing `--rule-w:4px` and `--text-sm:30px`. JS duplicates CSS values: `DUR = 0.85` (327) vs `--dur-move:850ms`, `PAD = 40` (328) vs `--space-md`; these can drift silently. Fix: in the module, `const DUR = parseFloat(rootStyle.getPropertyValue('--dur-move'))/1000; const PAD = parseFloat(rootStyle.getPropertyValue('--space-md'));`. Lower priority (NICE): layout widths/heights 1080/600/1060/270/200/230/760 (lines 102, 111, 123, 142, 149, 151) could become `--anc-h-*` / `--col-*` tokens, and the ease at line 389 is a cubic smoothstep, not `cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1)`, so the "matches" comment is only approximately true.
